<title>UK: Freddie Mac sets $70 million -year bond.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets $70 million -year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Sanwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $70 MLN	 COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    25.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  L-24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
